WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:04.220
Today I'll Pripara, tomorrow I'll Pripara,

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:08.920
and thinking about it, I yesterday I PriPara'd...

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:09.680
Huh?

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.780
Oh, Mega-neesan.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.190
Special report.

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:19.370
As of today, PriPara has been outlawed.

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:20.330
Eh?

00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:22.790
It's a real shame.

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:24.750
Eh?!

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:28.210
N-No way...

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:35.800
Ow ow ow!

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:41.690
Oh, PriPara being banned was only a dream.

00:00:41.690 --> 00:00:43.230
That's a relief.

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:45.520
Oh, Non, what is it?

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:47.250
You weren't dreaming.

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:49.440
It really happened, Onee-chan.

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:50.840
Look.

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:52.420
I repeat,

00:00:52.420 --> 00:00:55.520
PriPara has been outlawed.

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:57.240
PriPara is ding dong dead.

00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:00.030
You mean it wasn't just a bad dream?!

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:01.330
It's true.

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:04.960
It wasn't a dream!

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:38.770
PriPara Has Been Outlawed.

00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:43.930
PriPara being outlawed...

00:02:44.710 --> 00:02:46.590
I don't want that!

00:02:46.590 --> 00:02:48.940
Regardless of what's going on, I need to get to PriPara!

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:53.730
Principal!

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:56.400
This is horrible! PriPara has...

00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:58.430
Huh?

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:06.190
That Leona! She should've woken me up.

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:08.920
How thoughtless.

00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:15.900
Ah, Dorthy-san, I'm sorry!

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:17.390
Lala, be careful.

00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:18.880
You better run too, Dorthy-san!

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:19.260
Huh?

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:21.410
I can smell PriTickets.

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:22.010
Eh?!

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:24.120
I smell them!

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:26.300
Now that PriPara has been banned,

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:27.970
it's time to confiscate them!

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:29.740
Principal Ookanda?

00:03:29.740 --> 00:03:31.440
Come on!

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:34.700
Hand over your PriTickets!

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:36.230
PriTicket!

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:39.160
What's got into the Principal?

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:41.090
She's like her old self.

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:43.100
She started chasing me all of a sudden.

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:45.830
All because PriPara has been outlawed!

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:46.700
What?

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:48.000
Outlawed?

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:49.270
There's no way!

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:50.310
It's true!

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:52.720
Non said it was true, and it was on PriPara News...

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:55.130
For Pete's sake, this is why you're still a child.

00:03:56.010 --> 00:03:58.340
Look at this peaceful sky.

00:03:58.890 --> 00:04:00.800
Parajuku is like it normally is.

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:02.930
Let's forget about this crazy talk and head there.

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:04.260
But Dorthy-san!

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:06.470
Eh?

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:09.240
We're the PriTicket Confiscation Squad!

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:11.180
We'll be confiscating your PriTickets!

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:12.420
Now hand it over!

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:13.640
This way!
Now hand it over!

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:15.980
Hand them over-chanko!

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:18.230
PriTickets!

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:23.300
Ninja art of camouflage.

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:25.440
Is this real?

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:27.660
It's just like something I'd see in a bad dream.

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:30.620
This isn't a dream.

00:04:31.640 --> 00:04:33.950
I wonder if Leona is okay.

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:36.080
I'm sure Shion will take care of her, though.

00:04:36.570 --> 00:04:39.550
You sure are caring, Dorthy-san.

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:44.340
There's no one here.

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:46.970
Even Mega-neesan isn't here.

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:48.710
I wonder if we can still scan...?

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:52.490
It worked!

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:55.030
Uh....

00:05:04.960 --> 00:05:06.820
PriPara has been abandoned?

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:08.300
No way!

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:13.310
No way. My beloved PriPara has...

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:14.580
I don't want this!

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:16.540
Don't cry.

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:17.540
I'm not crying.

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:19.250
There's no way I'd cry!

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:21.040
I'm not going to cry!

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:23.170
If you say so, Dorthy.

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:24.940
Don't imitate Leona!

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:27.870
Dorthy, relax.

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:29.180
Like I said, don't imitate Leon-

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:31.640
Say it to me too...!

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:34.760
I-I see, you're the one who's scared.

00:05:35.380 --> 00:05:37.320
Lala, relax-

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:45.570
PriPara has been outlawed-kuma!

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:47.560
We're going to capture you-usa!

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:49.280
Nekon!

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:54.990
It seems like I've heard these monster's voices somewhere before...

00:05:54.990 --> 00:05:57.070
It's just your imagination-kuma.

00:05:57.070 --> 00:05:59.310
Capisce. Just my imagination.

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:00.600
W-Where's Leona?!

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:01.250
Who are you?

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:06.890
Leona and the others have been captured and
imprisoned in the cage known as the TV station.

00:06:06.890 --> 00:06:10.570
But that's something you shouldn't know-nekon.

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:12.850
L-Leona is...

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:17.040
Dorthy, I'll distract the monsters.

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:18.960
You go find the others!

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:20.440
Okay! Thank you!

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:21.710
Hold on a moment!

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:23.510
This makes you look like the cool one!

00:06:23.510 --> 00:06:25.460
We don't have time for that!

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:27.940
The better looking one is a better decoy!

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:29.910
Now get going!

00:06:30.380 --> 00:06:31.240
But!

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:31.970
Go!

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:33.230
You better find Leona!

00:06:33.230 --> 00:06:34.210
And Shion!

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:34.870
Dorthy!

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:36.080
Get going!

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:39.920
There's no way I can go!

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:42.540
Kuma!

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:44.300
Usa!

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:45.760
Nekon!

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:53.820
PriPara!

00:06:53.820 --> 00:06:54.530
Ha?

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:56.100
Huh?

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:01.280
Uh...

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:04.230
Operation: Heart pounding surprise!

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:05.020
Wow!

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:06.180
Eh?!

00:07:06.180 --> 00:07:08.890
Now, now, look over at the camera-usa!

00:07:08.890 --> 00:07:11.140
Yes, it was a huge success-nekon!

00:07:11.140 --> 00:07:12.030
Huh?

00:07:19.690 --> 00:07:20.670
What?

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:23.510
What the?!

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:25.150
Lala-chan!

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:26.560
Lala!

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:27.880
Capisce!

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:29.800
Lala, I love you!

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:31.760
What in the world?

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:34.810
1, 2...

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:35.720
Lala,

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:39.530
congratulations on your one year début anniversary!

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:43.720
One year?

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:44.900
Oh, I see.

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:47.700
It's been a year since you made your début, you know.

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:49.360
This is a commemoration party.

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:52.040
What about PriPara being outlawed?!

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:53.040
Yeah! Yeah!

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:55.450
That was to make it a bigger surprise-pri.

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:56.080
Eh?!

00:07:56.080 --> 00:08:00.790
Mega-nee, Non-chan, and everyone else all worked together.

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:01.830
Chanko!

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:02.750
Desuwa!

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:08.710
The abandoned PriPara ye saw earlier was generated with hologrammation.

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:12.020
You went overboard!

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:13.010
Completely.

00:08:13.780 --> 00:08:16.250
We were touched when you...

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:21.480
...rushed towards PriPara despite the obstacles in your way.

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:22.870
Yeah. Yeah.

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:25.160
You guys went the most overboard!

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:26.690
Kuma...
Usa.

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:29.780
But I'm glad you're safe, Leona.

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:33.350
You should have told me you were going to surprise Lala!

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:35.150
But I did tell you.

00:08:35.150 --> 00:08:37.310
You were just too busy reading your manga.

00:08:37.310 --> 00:08:38.080
Eh?!

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:41.240
It's your fault since you didn't listen-usa.

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:42.160
Shut your trap!

00:08:42.590 --> 00:08:49.450
I even tried to wake you up this morning thinking that if I left you, somehow you'd get mixed up in the surprise.

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:54.120
I'm glad it was all just a prank, Dorthy.

00:08:54.120 --> 00:08:56.440
Thanks for being a decoy with me.

00:08:57.650 --> 00:09:00.460
It's not like I did it for you, Lala.

00:09:00.460 --> 00:09:02.190
There's no need for your thanks.

00:09:03.490 --> 00:09:07.550
I'd like to thank Amamiya-kun for recording your trip to PriPara...

00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:12.910
...and the Newspaper Club member Tokuda Nene for recording everything once you got inside-pri.

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:14.470
All in a days work.

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:24.590
Now I would like to Invite our guest of honour, Lala-san, up to say a few words and Capisce-chanko.

00:09:24.590 --> 00:09:26.830
Lala-san, if you would-chanko.

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:28.580
You're up, Lala.

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:30.310
O-Okay.

00:09:30.310 --> 00:09:31.490
You can do it!

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:37.220
U-Um...

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:40.910
E-Everyone that's here for m-my sake t-today...

00:09:40.910 --> 00:09:42.280
Too stiff! Way too stiff!

00:09:42.280 --> 00:09:43.630
Relax!

00:09:43.630 --> 00:09:45.270
Y-Yeah...

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:55.900
Everyone, you all made me very capisce today!

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:58.360
Capisce!

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:01.270
Thanks, everyone!

00:10:02.430 --> 00:10:03.560
Lala.

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:07.500
So it's your one year début anniversary.

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:08.500
Congrats.

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:10.610
Thank you, Fuwari.

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:11.960
This made me so happy.

00:10:12.470 --> 00:10:14.950
Time flies when you're having fun-tori.

00:10:14.950 --> 00:10:18.780
Toriko will be a grandma pretty soon-tori.

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:21.930
Toriko will be all alone in her old age-tori!

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:24.300
A truly glorious Sabbat.

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:27.200
Since you're aiming for the Summer Dream Idol GranPrix,

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:30.020
shouldn't you be working to recruit Fuwari-nekon?

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:34.510
Naturally, I have not the slightest intention of
remaining concealed underground like a mole.

00:10:34.510 --> 00:10:37.030
Of course. So you have a plan-nekon?

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:41.240
Now onto some words of congratulation from our guests.

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:44.800
First up we have Mega-neesan. Please take it away-chanko.

00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:49.540
Lala-san, congratulations on your one year PriPara début anniversary.

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:52.360
However, I don't really have any gifts for the occasion...

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:54.140
Of course you don't-pri.

00:10:54.140 --> 00:10:58.420
I'm here to congratulate you on behalf of us secretaries.

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:00.670
That is all. Bye.

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:03.180
Next up...

00:11:03.530 --> 00:11:04.390
Mama?!

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:08.350
Lala, congrats on your one year début anniversary.

00:11:08.940 --> 00:11:11.720
To think you've become this beautiful...

00:11:11.720 --> 00:11:16.030
Thank you for being born as our child.

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:23.100
I hope you find PriPara to be as precious as your mother found it.

00:11:23.670 --> 00:11:26.830
Geez. You're saying too much, Mama.

00:11:27.690 --> 00:11:30.670
When Rina-chan was born, she had a weak constitution,

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:37.000
but by focusing on her and raising her seriously, she became this healthy...

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:42.190
Rina-chan, thank you for being manufactured to be my vacuum cleaner-desuwa!

00:11:42.190 --> 00:11:43.790
I totally love you!

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:48.930
Oh my PriPara-desuwa!
Oh my PriPara!

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:51.510
Congrats...

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:57.720
My childhood friend Lala has always been very shy.

00:11:57.720 --> 00:12:04.710
But now she has so many fans cheering her on as an idol.

00:12:04.710 --> 00:12:06.530
Keep on fighting the good fight!

00:12:07.570 --> 00:12:10.580
Lala-chan, congrats on your one year début anniversary.

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:15.280
Eiko-chan, thank you for being my fan for a whole year.

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:17.710
In tennis, you would be a service ace!

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:21.010
Next up is the pink actress, Nanami-chan-chanko!

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:23.540
I'm Nanami!

00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:24.430
Kyupiko-

00:12:33.720 --> 00:12:35.560
Kyupikon!

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:38.560
Nanami-chan, thank you-chanko.

00:12:38.560 --> 00:12:40.190
Now then, up next...

00:12:40.470 --> 00:12:41.530
Huh?

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:42.010
Eh?

00:12:42.010 --> 00:12:42.610
What's this?

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:43.290
What's happened?

00:12:43.290 --> 00:12:43.990
What's going on?

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:46.040
Just what's going on?

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:47.040
Lala!

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:55.330
Let's celebrate your one year début anniversary!

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:57.630
You've always worked so hard!

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:58.820
That's right!

00:12:58.820 --> 00:13:02.630
We have a celebratory concert from her rivals, Dressing Parfait!

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:04.590
Wow! I'm so happy!

00:13:04.910 --> 00:13:08.470
I'll never forget how you were there for me today!

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:10.430
I won't forget either.

00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:14.240
Let's Go steal the spotlight!

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:17.730
Dressing Parfait's "Change! My World"!

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:56.770
Making Drama Switch On!

00:14:01.780 --> 00:14:02.610
Drums!

00:14:07.370 --> 00:14:08.490
Guitar!

00:14:12.270 --> 00:14:13.610
Bass!

00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:17.580
Stereo at full blast! 2x3=Rock!

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:20.830
And Lala, congrats!

00:14:21.990 --> 00:14:24.830
Cyalume Change!

00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:31.430
Go!

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:44.060
Shion rocks!
You knocked it out of the park!

00:14:44.060 --> 00:14:44.210
Usa!

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:44.840
You knocked it out of the park!

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:45.560
Chanko!

00:14:45.560 --> 00:14:46.740
Nekon!

00:14:49.050 --> 00:14:50.640
Since we're celebrating today,

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:56.030
I've designed a new Cyalume Coord for SoLaMi Smile and Dressing Parfait.

00:14:56.030 --> 00:14:58.660
I think you'll look pretty cosmic good in it!

00:14:59.100 --> 00:15:01.980
Flawless and broad minded!

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:04.380
Have you warmed up some, Lala?

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:07.370
I'll just keep on saying it, thank you!

00:15:07.370 --> 00:15:08.840
Thank you so much!

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:15.600
I was happy to know how much you love PriPara when you almost cried, Dorthy.

00:15:15.600 --> 00:15:16.870
Almost cried?

00:15:17.570 --> 00:15:19.040
What are you talking about?

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:20.660
I didn't cry!

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:29.160
Fuwari-sama, the princess scholarship student, has a brightly shining aura and overflows with vitality.

00:15:29.710 --> 00:15:32.000
Please get me her autograph, Onee-chan!

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:33.530
Cute!

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:35.510
"Fuwari-sama"...

00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:38.360
And we end with...

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:41.170
Falulu!

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:43.580
Have you been well, Lala?

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:45.560
Energetic and lively!

00:15:45.560 --> 00:15:48.160
Compared to your Parajuku PriPara,

00:15:48.160 --> 00:15:51.390
I have Puripari PriPara.

00:15:51.390 --> 00:15:53.150
While we may be far apart,

00:15:53.150 --> 00:15:54.390
we'll always be together.

00:15:55.020 --> 00:15:56.540
Falulu...

00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:57.600
Capisce!

00:15:58.090 --> 00:16:01.370
I also have one more surprise for you.

00:16:02.030 --> 00:16:04.900
I am supposed to get a summer vacation.

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:08.270
When I do, I'm going to come visit you!

00:16:08.270 --> 00:16:09.500
See you soon!

00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:10.760
Hooray!

00:16:12.010 --> 00:16:14.320
That was a great surprise!

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:19.230
Everyone, thank you so much for everything today!

00:16:19.230 --> 00:16:27.710
Concert!

00:16:29.890 --> 00:16:32.760
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:36.010
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:39.990
Coord Change Start!

00:16:42.490 --> 00:16:47.360
This romantic coord really suits your one year PriPara début anniversary.

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:52.840
The different colours really bring out all three of your personalities!

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:55.200
Which one do I like, you ask?

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:57.890
I can't decide. They're all too cute!

00:16:57.890 --> 00:17:00.040
Dream Heart Race Coord!

00:17:00.840 --> 00:17:01.700
Pri!

