00:18:28.070 --> 00:18:32.630
Lala, congratulations on your one year début anniversary!

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:36.250
Thank you!

00:18:43.470 --> 00:18:45.970
A pop and a step and I've gotcha!

00:18:46.530 --> 00:18:48.310
I love you all!

00:18:48.820 --> 00:18:52.190
Please continue to support me and capisce!

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:55.300
Capisce!

