SoLaMi Smile's Friend Ticket snapping event is over here.

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:07.150
Please line up here-chanko!

00:19:07.150 --> 00:19:08.120
Welcome-kuma!

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:09.580
Welkuma!

00:19:09.940 --> 00:19:15.110
Lala's one year début anniversary emblem, designed by Houjou Cosmos, is now on sale-kuma!

00:19:15.110 --> 00:19:16.920
Make sure you buy one!

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:18.420
And on top of that,

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:21.790
