00:19:21.790 --> 00:19:25.520
Capisce marionettes, Capisce mufflers, Capisce margaritas, Capisce merlions, Capisce frames, Capisce margarine,

00:19:25.520 --> 00:19:28.760
Capisce Paris daisies, Capisce grapes, Capisce cloaks, rice balls, bread, sandwiches, juices, teas, towels, handkerchiefs,

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:31.110
