00:19:31.110 --> 00:19:32.060
Yeah!

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:36.190
We've also made 200,000 stuffed animals of me-kuma.

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:41.760
We're selling them so I can have the hibernation of my dreams in a 17LDKS cave with a smile on my face-kuma.

00:19:41.760 --> 00:19:43.220
Like a celeb!

00:19:49.520 --> 00:19:52.460
PriPara and concerts are lots of fun!

