00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:31.000
<i>An elegant princess will usher in a new dawn on the world of idols just like the rising sun.</i>

00:20:31.530 --> 00:20:32.510
Wow.

00:20:34.490 --> 00:20:39.090
<i>To help you, I've given you a perfect Making Drama.</i>

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:46.720
<i>You are a princess born from nature, just like a nightingale who can sing by instinct.</i>

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:49.270
<i>Now be dyed in my colour.</i>

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:56.810
For me, Prince-sama...

00:20:58.370 --> 00:20:59.130
